  "description": {
    "text": "The HS Trainer Kit, released in 2010 in English and European languages only, held two 30-card half decks, Gyarados and Raichu, with a HeartGold & SoulSilver booster pack, damage and status counters, a Pikachu coin, a playmat, a deck box and a Trainer Kit Guide for each half deck that walks players through an example battle. The cards are reprints from HeartGold & SoulSilver with the kit's own set symbol and no rarity mark; the featured Pokémon have artwork different from their HeartGold & SoulSilver cards.\n\nThis set holds the Raichu half deck."
  },
